1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,932
Bachche school chale jaate hain, aur main din bhar bas paudhon ko paani deti hoon.

2
00:00:05,232 --> 00:00:11,828
Geeta beti, yahi to hunar hai! Paudhon ki nursery khol. Aajkal har ghar mein paudhe chahiye!

3
00:00:12,128 --> 00:00:15,316
Par Kaka, nursery ke liye badi zameen chahiye na?

4
00:00:15,616 --> 00:00:21,679
Nahi, aangan bhi kaafi hai. Green net, gamle, mitti aur paudhe, 60 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:21,979 --> 00:00:27,619
Cutting aur beej se khud paudhe bana. 10 rupaye ka paudha, 100 mein bikta hai!

6
00:00:28,169 --> 00:00:32,181
Madam, naye ghar ke liye 50 paudhe chahiye. Gamle samet!

7
00:00:32,481 --> 00:00:37,111
Money plant, snake plant, sab hai. 250 rupaye ka ek, gamle samet!

8
00:00:37,411 --> 00:00:42,989
Ek order se saadhe barah hazaar! Mahine ke 40 hazaar tak aaram se.

9
00:00:43,289 --> 00:00:48,462
Garden banane aur dekhbhaal ka theka bhi le. Har mahine pakki kamai.

10
00:00:48,762 --> 00:00:51,681
Hariyali se khushhali! Geeta ki life set!
